SUMMARY:The Neon Room at Helium: Catacombs & Comedians
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 1510 SE 9th Ave\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Stand-up comedy crosses swords with Dungeons & Dragons. Catacom
 bs & Comedians is a live actual-play D&D show featuring four comedians as t
 hey venture in a realm of drollery and tomfoolery. Join Tyson Cox\, Cavin E
 ggleston\, Eric Sablan\, and Elliott White as they roleplay as an amusing a
 dventuring party of intrepid heroes as they venture in a realm of drollery 
 and tomfoolery.\n\nThe Catacombs & Comedians live actual-play Dungeons & Dr
 agons comedy show has performed in comedy clubs and theaters\, as well as w
 ith online streaming programs with dozens of stand-up comedians. The comedi
 c players never know what Dungeon Master Dan Taylor will throw at their par
 ty. From the monstrous Fowlboar (a cross between a giant turkey and a boar)
  to Clownbolds (Juggalo Kobolds) to Spellbilly Warlocks. Nothing is too out
 rageous.\n\nWhat better way to celebrate the eve of the largest and longest
 -running gaming convention in North America than by rolling for hilarity an
 d making a joke of the world’s greatest role playing game.\n\nManagement 
 reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they
  deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedya
 tlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/the-neon-room-at-helium-catacombs-comedians/
